Package: scst-ctl-device-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Kubernetes device plugin for the SCST control node.
 Advertises /dev/iscsi-scst-ctl to Kubernetes via the device plugin API so
 the SCST iSCSI gateway pod can obtain the SCST control device without
 running privileged. Built with the distro Go toolchain from vendored
 dependencies, so the build is air-gapped by construction.
